- Benjamini & Hochberg (1995): false discovery rate
- Wilson (1927): score interval
- McNemar (1947): paired proportions
- Kaplan & Meier (1958): survival curves
- Greenacre, "Correspondence Analysis in Practice": MCA, adjusted inertia
- Rasch (1960): the zero-dimension model
- Johnson (2014), "Logistic Matrix Factorization for Implicit Feedback Data": the notebook's link
- Tversky & Kahneman (1981), "The Framing of Decisions and the Psychology of Choice": Coriander / Cilantro
